# ubturbo-rmrs: lintian overrides
#
# The following lintian tags are emitted by design because the Debian
# packaging mirrors the upstream RPM spec (ubturbo.spec). They are reviewed
# and considered acceptable.

# The upstream RPM spec installs everything under /opt/ubturbo/. This path is
# hardcoded in the daemon (ub_turbo_exec), the IPC socket path, config loading,
# and the systemd service unit. Migrating to FHS standard paths would require
# coordinated changes across the entire upstream codebase.
ubturbo-rmrs: dir-or-file-in-opt
